---
import Page from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Enrolling others in the possibility of EPM" description="Archived blog post from rondimon.com — April 2, 2013">

  <section class="container py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl animate-in">
      <a href="/about/archive" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        Archive
      </a>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-4">April 2, 2013</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">
        Enrolling others in the possibility of EPM
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl prose-archive">
      <p>I just blogged a bit more about the purpose of my book over <a href="http://www.checkpointllc.com/content/epm-done-right">here</a> at the CheckPoint Consulting blog - check it out!</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Page>
